<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-DENMARK LEAD HUNGARY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DENMARK LEAD HUNGARY 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>AALBORG, Denmark 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark lead Hungary 2-0 after the opening singles in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one first reound tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:  Frederik Fetterlein beat Jozsef Krocsko 6-4 6-2 7-5  Kenneth Carlsen beat Attila Savolt 6-4 6-4 7-6 (7-3)  REUTER  072021 GMT feb 97</p>
</text>
